    "Sets of row and column indices work. To use constant space instead, ask which cells of the grid could hold your markers, and what information is already in them.",
    "Use the first row and first column as marker storage, with two booleans remembering whether they held a zero themselves. Fill the interior from the markers first, then handle the first row and column last."
  ],
